1
00:00:00,475 --> 00:00:04,515
We're not... Where's my Bat-Signal?

2
00:00:05,146 --> 00:00:08,856
- You have a Bat-Signal?
- I did.

3
00:00:09,108 --> 00:00:11,398
(Leonard:)It was right here.

4
00:00:11,777 --> 00:00:13,567
She must have...

5
00:00:14,238 --> 00:00:16,828
(Leonard:)Oh, my God, we're living together.

6
00:00:18,201 --> 00:00:20,451
(Penny:)Really? What was your first clue?

7
00:00:35,134 --> 00:00:36,804
(Howard:)New pants?

8
00:00:36,969 --> 00:00:39,469
(Leonard:)Yeah. Stephanie got them for me.

9
00:00:40,556 --> 00:00:41,846
(Howard:)Nice. Cotton?

10
00:00:42,016 --> 00:00:45,806
(Leonard:)Actually, I think
it's more of a wool-fire ant blend.

11
00:00:46,729 --> 00:00:49,609
(Howard:)The girlfriend's buying clothes for you, huh?
Sounds serious.

12
00:00:49,774 --> 00:00:53,564
(Leonard:)It is, actually.
In fact, I gave it a lot of thought...

13
00:00:53,736 --> 00:00:58,026
(Leonard:)...and I decided it was time
for us to live together.

